  "replies": 29,
  "topic": "vps",
  "text": "What do you think this $46k bill breaks down into?\n\nI dug into the site and its aggressively cached and images aren't hosted on Vercel.\n\nSome quick math makes it line up with being mostly Bandwidth (Fast Data Transfer) and Edge Requests",
